title: Fix CI change filtering at the producer

doc:
  - audience: Node Dev
    description: |
      Normalize the shared preflight change-filter output to 'true' for relevant changes
      and an empty string otherwise, preserving all existing consuming job conditions.
      Documentation exclusions cover only Markdown, Mermaid and PNG files under docs/.
      Rust changes, other docs files, caller workflows, shared preflight and shared CI
      inputs (env, actions, scripts and the runtimes matrix) enable the guarded jobs.
      Final aggregate checks depend directly on preflight so its failure or cancellation
      cannot be hidden by skipped downstream jobs. Event exclusions are unchanged.
      No crates require publishing.
crates: []
